{"ID":"20240515131400-ynlp4np","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131400-ynlp4np","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131400-ynlp4np\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141748-kabubu1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141748-kabubu1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141748-kabubu1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:409,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:409\u0026#125;","title":"080","type":"doc","updated":"20240515172431"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141748-kabubu1","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1044px;","id":"20240515141748-kabubu1","updated":"20240515172431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"37歲"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/08"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前曾來求嗣，服藥後有懷孕但後來流產。此次前來希望調好身體以求嗣。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少腹最近幾天隱脹滿，自覺與月經無關，月經下週來。雙足溫中等。足後跟痠痛。睡不好，多夢。大便二三天一次，成形。胃口好。口渴有喜室溫飲。小便顏色沒注意。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈洪浮無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃薄白"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 虛熱  心血不足"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連二錢  黃芩三錢  白芍六錢  阿膠三錢(分三包烊盡)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"熟地二錢  澤瀉三錢  山茱萸三錢  淮山藥三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丹皮三錢  茯苓三錢  補骨脂三錢  川芎三錢梔子三錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茜草三錢  當歸二錢服時加生蛋黃一只  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10帖  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗水煮成3 碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各喝一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.多夢乃心神漂浮，神不藏，心中那滴血不足以藏神。 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.此方吃到下次月經結束 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.此方內含活血化瘀藥，因為患者述上次流產後來的月經過了七天還未淨 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.虛熱時月經來了吃阿膠不會止血。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}